{"data":{"body":"[P3] Follow the mandatory enum-import convention\n\nAGENTS.md's \u201cJava Style (MUST follow)\u201d requires static imports for enum constants. These new assertions use qualified `EmitMode.ON_COMPLETE` and `OperationDetail.TOP_LEVEL`, so the test code violates that requirement despite being functionally correct. Under CONTRIBUTING.md rule 9, return to the design phase in rule 8, step 6, and align the test approach with the required import convention.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc8AAAABCsCVQQ","finding_digest":"a1e3982bcc9add68018fced6f9e948d3382f149807ce8931e911c0cfad442539","finding_id":"arf_v1_uhrzqk6mtlowqampz3lpt2ki2m","finding_key":"conformance-tests-telemetry::telemetryconformanceconfigtest.telemetryconfigmatchestherunnerexpectations::required-static-enum-imports","identity_key":"conformance-tests-telemetry::telemetryconformanceconfigtest.telemetryconfigmatchestherunnerexpectations::required-static-enum-imports","line":58,"observation_digest":"7d4a66bfd1978f9fad526f2d139639df35a779d52e9a61751e1da8d46068d1e5","observation_id":"aro_v1_pvfgnp6rs6hz7lksn4wrhfrz34","path":"conformance-tests-telemetry/src/test/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/conformance/telemetry/TelemetryConformanceConfigTest.java","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-11-05T01:06:22Z","review_id":"arr_v1_cqgtwcxxcof4zllc3klkbil5rg","reviewed_base_sha":"98c60fa033f0ad4bc4ddd067bda10a00796c9d8c","reviewed_head_sha":"0ccc30f2391c9e790b1246321e583bd416f9f014","reviewer":"codex","start_line":56,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":876},"record_id":"art_v1_c76tw5yzin7nenz7lsutaxmq6o","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-11-05T01:06:22Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
